      "changelog": "Initial release of xiaozhi-teach-schedule-manager:\n\n- Provides systematic scheduling and lesson-hour management for independent teachers.\n- Includes visual weekly schedules, student/teacher availability matrices, automatic conflict detection, and transparent lesson-hour tracking.\n- Standardizes workflows for leave, make-up lessons, and rescheduling, with clear process documentation.\n- Integrates with solo-dashboard, student-intake, lesson-log, and parent-communication for full data flow.\n- Adds pre-set alerts for lesson-hour package shortages and expirations, making time and package management more proactive.",
